      "text": "1642 ─── TASMAN: New Zealand, Tasmania, Tonga, Fiji. First European.\n  1741 ─── VITUS BERING (Danish, Russian service): Alaska coast. Bering Sea.\n  1766 ─── WALLIS: Tahiti. Claimants for Britain.\n  1766–69 ─ BOUGAINVILLE: Tahiti, French account.\n  1768–71 ─ COOK: First voyage. New Zealand circumnavigation. East Australia coast.\n  1772–75 ─ COOK: Second voyage. Antarctic Circle crossed. No Terra Australis.\n  1776–79 ─ COOK: Third voyage. Pacific Northwest. Death in Hawaii.\n  1785–88 ─ LA PEROUSE: French equivalent of Cook. Lost without trace.\n  1791–95 ─ VANCOUVER: Pacific Northwest coast survey. Precise mapping.\n```"
